    "title": "Triple Body Butter -Rose",
    "descriptionHtml": "<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">DYU Triple Body Butter - Rose blends cocoa, mango, and shea butter with coconut oil and rose absolute to deliver deep, lasting hydration while leaving skin soft, smooth, and beautifully scented. </span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Infused with Rose Centifolia Absolute, this body butter soothes the senses with a gentle floral aroma while helping calm inflammation and restore the skin's natural glow and suppleness. </span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Cocoa and mango butter work together to nourish dry, rough skin and provide a rich, creamy texture that melts on contact and absorbs easily without feeling greasy or sticky. </span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Shea butter and coconut oil offer intense moisturization, protecting against dryness, improving elasticity, and helping to repair damaged skin from environmental stressors and pollutants. </span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Enriched with vitamin E, this chemical-free body moisturiser promotes skin repair and rejuvenation, making it perfect for daily use on dry areas like elbows, knees, hands, and feet.</span></li>\n</ul>",
